ROW root-original 0 COLON
ROW root-other 0 PLAIN
ROW root-colon-query 0 :::lost
ROW root-plain-query 0 ::lost
ROW leading-namespace-original 0 LEADING_NAMESPACE
ROW leading-namespace-rooted-report 0 ORDINARY_NAMESPACE
ROW leading-namespace-inscope 0 LEADING_NAMESPACE
ROW trailing-namespace-root-join 0 ORDINARY_NAMESPACE
ROW trailing-namespace-inscope 0 TRAILING_NAMESPACE
ROW bracket-root-context 0 BRACKET_NAMESPACE
ROW bracket-rooted-context 0 BRACKET_NAMESPACE
ROW live-root-commands 0 {tell socket subst open eof lremove pwd glob list pid exec auto_load_index time unknown eval coroinject lassign lrange fblocked lsearch auto_import gets throw lappend proc break variable llength auto_execok return linsert error ledit catch lpop clock info split array if fconfigure coroutine concat join lreplace source fcopy global switch auto_qualify update fpclassify close cd for auto_load file append lreverse format lmap unload :lost read package set namespace binary scan apply trace const seek zlib while lost chan flush after vwait capture dict uplevel continue lseq try foreach lset rename fileevent yieldto timerate regexp zipfs lrepeat upvar tailcall encoding unset expr load regsub interp exit coroprobe puts incr lindex lsort tclLog string yield}
